WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.217
DNA only gets built one way.

00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:03.134
Here's why.

00:00:03.447 --> 00:00:05.131
Every strand has two different ends.

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:06.489
The 5-prime end.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:07.998
And the 3-prime end.

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:09.972
New pieces can only snap onto the

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:10.843
3-prime end.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.269
So new DNA always grows 5-prime to

00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:14.001
3-prime.

00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:14.883
One way.

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:15.684
Every time.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:17.240
But it can't start from nothing.

00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:18.587
Swipe.
